  "anchor": "Cities sec 6 founder revision. Per-country business formation costs by legal tier. Global category names first (Sole Trader, LLC, Joint-Stock); local term in parentheses where the country uses a distinct name. Cost figures in local-currency USD-equivalent for reference (refined per-country as we add depth). setup_days is a typical online filing turnaround for the registered office. This seed covers the 14 highest-traffic countries; the rest fall through to an empty-state on the city page.",
